<title>FRANCE: French Bourse suspends Essilor.</title>
<headline>French Bourse suspends Essilor.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The SBF French Bourses' Association said it had suspended ordinary shares and other paper in Essilor International pending a statement due later today.</p>
<p>It said Essilor would restart trading on Thursday at normal hours.</p>
<p>The suspension started at 1203 GMT at 1,684 francs, up 27 francs or 1.63 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
